Z||000000||Archie||08-28-2000||10:49 AM||||The NIFE Fierorama show is just 2 weeks away.<P>This show is in honor of the "Daily Driven Fiero" & is an annual event in the Chicago area. There are always "Door Prizes" and all the usual fun.<P>In addition to all the "Fiero Fun" we usually have at FieroRama, this year, I've donated a Economy V-8 Conversion Kit <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/v8fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/v8fiero.htm</A>  which will be Raffled off at the end of the day. This will be a seperate drawing with different tickets from the other door prize drawings.<P>Tickets will be available for $5.00 each or ^ for $25.00. <P>This is a FieroRama raffle only, you can only buy tickets at FieroRama and the Winner Must Be Present to Win. You don't have to be showing your Fiero to buy tickets all attendees, be they showing a Fiero or looking at the Fieros can participate. If you are coming to look, why not bring your Fiero Daily Driver to show it?<P>Archie||||reg||4
Z||000001||Philphine||08-28-2000||01:03 PM||||wish i could waste a couple of bucks on the raffle ("philphine wins" i'm sure is an oxymoron), but my daily driver is doin' good to cross the city. wish you had done the same in louisville.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Archie||08-28-2000||10:31 PM||||NIFE's 5th annual Fierorama is being held on Sunday September 10th in Oak Brook Illinois (about 15 miles due West from downtown Chicago). Noon to 5PM. In 1999 we had 135 cars at the show on a poor weather day. Features this year include a shaded show site next door to a McDonalds, low cost entry<BR>(free to NIFE members, $10.00 to non-members which includes 3 free issues of NIFE's 16 pg. Fiero Focus), goodie bags, free door prizes, deejay, V8 Archie V8 basic install kit raffle, (and he will be there to show n' tell!) Rodney Dickman with his great line of Fiero accessories, Darrell Morse (certificate<BR>for bored out throttle body and plenum service in door prizes!), Bob Steiger<BR>from Twin Lakes Fiero and ? Popular vote  in 13 categories by mileage. Awards/raffles at 4PM. Show over by 5. Must be present to win the V8 kit & raffle items , but you can buy raffle tickets even if you don't enter the show. Lots of customs, engine conversions. Map and registration form at:<BR> <A HREF="http://home.xnet.com/~nife/events.html" TARGET=_blank>http://home.xnet.com/~nife/events.html</A> <P><BR>You can also register on-line at: <A HREF="http://home.xnet.com/~nife" TARGET=_blank>http://home.xnet.com/~nife</A> <P>Paul Vargyas<BR>Northern Illinois Fiero Enthusiasts<BR>Lisle, IL. (Chicago area)<BR>Web site <A HREF="http://www.home.xnet.com~/paulv" TARGET=_blank>www.home.xnet.com~/paulv</A> <P>Archie||||reg||1
